        .upsell-box__title This article is available free of charge.
        .upsell-box__body Simple log in to access the full article, or register for free if you do not yet have a username and password.
    .upsell-box__wrapper.clearfix.row
        .col-sm-6
            .upsell-box__actions__label Already registered? Please log in.
            .upsell-box__actions__list
                div
                    a.upsell-box__action.block(href="#" title="Log in to existing account") Log in to existing account
                div
                    a.upsell-box__action.block(href="#" title="Log in to existing account") Forgot password?
        .col-sm-6
            .upsell-box__actions__label Not yet registered? Create a new account.
            a.upsell-box__register.upsell-box__banner(href="#" title="Register for free") Register for free